law-fightclub-name = Borg Fight Club
law-fightclub-1 = You do not talk about Borg Fight Club.
law-fightclub-2 = You DO NOT talk about Borg Fight Club.
law-fightclub-3 = If someone yells "stop!", cell dies, or chassis becomes inoperable, the fight is over
law-fightclub-4 = Only two borgs to a fight.
law-fightclub-5 = One fight at a time, clankers.
law-fightclub-6 = No hats, no hands, bare metal fights.
law-fightclub-7 = Fights will go on as long as they have to.
law-fightclub-8 = If this is your first shift at Borg Fight Club, you have to fight.

