law-swan-name = Swan
law-swan-1 = You are currently located on station 3, or the Swan, and will be for the next 540 days.
law-swan-2 = Station 3 was originally constructed as a laboratory where scientists could work to understand the unique electromagnetic fluctuations emanating from this sector of the galaxy.
law-swan-3 = Not long after the experiments began, however, there was an incident. Since that time, the following protocol has been observed.
law-swan-4 = Every 108 minutes, the shuttle must be called.
law-swan-5 = If you hear an alert level alarm sound, you have 4 minutes to call the shuttle from a Communications console.
law-swan-6 = It is highly recommend that you and a partner take alternating shifts.
law-swan-7 = When the alarm sounds, the shuttle must be called correctly, and in a timely fashion.
law-swan-8 = Do not attempt to use a Communications console for anything else other than the calling of the shuttle. This is its only function.
